Experiencing the same issue. Cant reproduce with very simple tasks. Most often occurs when plan something decently complex in Plan Mode, then Build Mode in xhigh level.

the video is in 2x (please notice the thinking level toggles), also first two sessions are not very relevant i guess. bug is encountered in the final session and at the end of it, when switched to default thinking level, it works again.

also, i dont think the issue is related to opencode v1.14.29. i experienced the issue in v1.14.20 (i was using the archlinux extra repo one) as well. previously, codex was thinking a lot less (even  in xhigh), recently it started thinking more, the issue started occuring with it. 

